{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53390","headline":"奉送日本国使空海上人橘秀才朝献後却还 · 昙靖","name":"奉送日本国使空海上人橘秀才朝献後却还","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"异国桑门客，乘杯望斗星。\n来朝汉天子，归译竺乾经。\n万里洪涛白，三春孤岛青。\n到宫方奏对，图像列王庭。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"昙靖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53390.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53390","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}